      "A strong BOND isn't permission\\n",
      "to speak for them.$"
    ],
    "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_2F_Text_DevelopingNewBalls": [
      "I'm testing new POKé BALLS.\\p",
      "Field reliability comes first.$"
    ],
