      "Young TRAINERS help with that.$"
    ],
    "RustboroCity_DevonCorp_3F_Text_ThisIs3rdFloorWaitHere": [
      "HORIZON research floor.\\p",
      "Thanks for recovering the parts.\\p",
      "In PORTO DO SAL, take them to\\n",
      "the HARBOR ENGINEER.\\p",
      "OTACILIO also wants to see you.\\p",
